{"id":"nezametno","lemma":"незаметно","pos":"adv","rank":3105,"glosses":["imperceptibly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1f/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Поначалу это было почти незаметно.","en":"It was almost unnoticeable at first.","words":[{"g":"at first"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"almost, nearly"},null]},{"text":"Не подкрадывайся к другим незаметно.","en":"Don't sneak up on people.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to"},null,null]},{"text":"Старость подкрадывается незаметно.","en":"Old age creeps upon us unnoticed.","words":[{"g":"old age"},null,null]},{"text":"Я попытался незаметно улизнуть с вечеринки.","en":"I tried to make an inconspicuous exit from the party.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"попытаться"},null,{"g":"to slip away"},{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"soirée, evening party","l":"вечеринка"}]},{"text":"Старость подкрадывается к нам незаметно.","en":"Old age creeps up on us before we know it.","words":[{"g":"old age"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null]}]}